  "title": "Repair Ticket",
  "summary": "Marisol reports live from the shop: Ben is kind, settled and has his sister's eyebrows. She has to write her number on the repair ticket, which is Ben's old number. That evening Ben texts: 'she sent you, didn't she.' He tells Marisol the part Hana left out: when he came out, Hana told him not to make it everyone's business. Marisol keeps Hana's secret, then confronts her. Hana reads it and drives away without a word.",
