        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m06",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "took me an hour to work out why it looked familiar. so. hana?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m07",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "she's in town. your mom's having heart surgery wednesday. she wanted you to know, and she wanted to know you were ok"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m08",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "and she couldn't ask me herself."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m09",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "she was scared"
