        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m10",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "yeah. she's good at that."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m11",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "that's not fair"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m12",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "you want fair?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m13",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "i came out to my parents in march 2020. i was 30. dad stood up and said he didn't have a son. mom started clearing the plates."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m14",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "hana walked me to my car after. you know what she said?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m15",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "'maybe you could just not make it everyone's business.'"
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m16",
          "sender": "ben",
          "text": "that's the last thing my sister said to me."
        },
        {
          "kind": "message",
          "id": "m17",
          "sender": "marisol",
          "text": "ben. i'm so sorry"
        },
